#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:51 4917825e49dd4d0e9180ab798363ef75
msgid "Example: Dobot to ARX"
msgstr "示例：从 Dobot 切换到 ARX"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:53 809f3e7e46ff4e6a9560964f65b561f0
msgid ""
"# Current: Dobot CR5\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=dobot_cr5 "
"hardware:=mock\n"
"\n"
"# Initialize ARX descriptions\n"
"cd src/robot_descriptions\n"
"git submodule update --init robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"\n"
"# Rebuild\n"
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-up-to robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with ARX\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone "
"hardware:=mock\n"
msgstr ""
"# Current: Dobot CR5\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=dobot_cr5 hardware:=mock\n"
"\n"
"# Initialize ARX descriptions\n"
"cd src/robot_descriptions\n"
"git submodule update --init robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"\n"
"# Rebuild\n"
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-up-to robot-descriptions-arx\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"\n"
"# Launch with ARX\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone hardware:=mock\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:70 f51cc8ae9f7340a79bb290cccea5842c
msgid "With Grippers"
msgstr "搭配夹爪"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:72 75b2f3498d3e42c0b0087b360701cd9a
msgid ""
"Different robots support different grippers. The `gripper:=` parameter "
"specifies the end-effector."
msgstr "不同机器人支持不同的夹爪。`gripper:=` 参数用于指定末端执行器。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:74 8811a00fdc864e32976ab71b2f32c6df
msgid "TODO"
msgstr "待完成"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:77 46975a0ca3df41eea7aa61a00def376f
msgid ""
"For valid robot + gripper combinations and exact launch syntax, check the"
" launch files in `arms_ros2_control` and the specific robot description "
"packages. Not all combinations are supported."
msgstr "有效的机器人与夹爪组合及确切启动语法，请查看 `arms_ros2_control` 中的启动文件以及对应的机器人描述软件包。并非所有组合都受支持。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-switch_robot.md:80 5442bd7551c04eab8c75acbc98c6d2f6
msgid ""
"# General pattern\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=<robot_name> "
"gripper:=<gripper_name> hardware:=mock\n"
msgstr ""
"# General pattern\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=<robot_name> gripper:=<gripper_name> hardware:=mock\n"

